cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and this archive."
title: "Analysis code for Koyama et al., IFN-gamma-driven MHC class II expression by intestinal epithelial cells dictates local cytolytic Th1 differentiation and intestinal stem cell loss"
abstract: >-
  Single-cell RNA-sequencing analysis code for Koyama et al. (Science
  Immunology). Regenerates Figures 4, 7, S3, S6, S7, S10 and S11 from the
  processed matrices deposited in NCBI GEO under accession GSE348009. Five
  self-contained R Markdown files, one per figure group, each requiring a
  single edited path.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
